    },
    "基于开源项目深度定制的中文演讲/录制提词器。\\n\\n• 完整汉化界面\\n• 接入本地语音大模型\\n• 优化中文跟读同步稳定性\\n\\n能在您朗读或口播时，确保文案平滑滚动，不“乱跳”，且无需上传任何语音数据至云端。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A deeply customized teleprompter for Chinese speech/recording based on an open source project.\\n\\n• Fully localized interface\\n• Local voice model integration\\n• Optimized Chinese read-along sync stability\\n\\nEnsures smooth scrolling without \"jumping\" exactly as you speak, keeping your data entirely local."
          }
        }
      }
